<div style="text-align: center;">
<blockquote>
<p><strong><em>Why when we do our darkest deeds</em></strong><br />
<strong><em>Do we tell?</em></strong><br />
<strong><em>They burn in our brains</em></strong><br />
<strong><em>Become a living hell</em></strong><br />
<strong><em>'Cause everybody tells</em></strong><br />
<strong><em>Everybody tells</em></strong></p>
</blockquote>
</div>
<p>Well, here it is. This is something I've been working on for almost six months now. Gone through a torrent of revisions, draft threads, rewrites, and finally ended up on the mainlist.</p>
<p>Thank you to Tanhony, Yossipossi, DrAkimoto, Oboebandgeek, and stormbreath for reviewing this. Thank you to everyone else for all the help you gave on previous versions of this, wouldn't be here without you guys.</p>
<p>While you're here, be sure to <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/cerastes-informational-file">check out some of my other works</a>.</p>
<p><strong>Disclaimer: The old 2510 was deleted due to plagiarism, which I had nothing to do with. This is an entirely separate article that I placed into the available slot.</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7i5Q_jfnaKQ&amp;feature=youtu.be">Now with audio adaptation by TheeSherm!</a></p>

