<p>I enjoyed this and upvoted right after reading it! But after thinking about it for a little while, I'm afraid it might fall into the &quot;readers are smarter than the Foundation&quot; trap. It isn't hard for a reader to infer what happened here, and it seems like Agent Barnes has at least an inkling, too. But it seems like a criminally negligent lack of action in the Foundation's response!</p>
<p>The anomaly MIGHT be unique to Samantha McArthur. But what if the source of it is Kevin Cosniak? Or Derek Thompson? Why not have an undercover agent embedded to keep an eye on them?</p>
<p>Otherwise, there might be a string of unremembered corpses in bathrooms following one or both of them through college.</p>

